Notable transitive groupings: serde/serde_core/serde_derive;
toml/toml_datetime/toml_parser/toml_writer/winnow; thiserror/thiserror-impl;
tempfile/fastrand/rustix/linux-raw-sys; sha2/digest/block-buffer/
crypto-common/typenum/cpufeatures; getrandom/cfg-if/libc; clap's
builder/derive/lex stack with anstream/anstyle; ureq's HTTP stack
(ureq-proto/http/httparse) and its rustls TLS stack (rustls/ring/
rustls-webpki/webpki-roots/untrusted); serde_json/itoa/memchr; and the
ICU/Unicode-3.0 crates pulled in by url/idna.
